{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An art museum has asked for your assistance. Help them out by painting beautiful portraits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/extras/2874443f8666b39186fe512d5b46fc58.avif?t=1771609277\" alt=\"Freedom with limitation\" width=618 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint in any way you want, with any colors you'd like. A maximum of 12 colors will challenge you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/extras/47e9d1c9fef499d10c4e9620312c3a58.poster.avif?t=1771609277\" aria-label=\"Different colors are selected in a UI\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/extras/47e9d1c9fef499d10c4e9620312c3a58.webm?t=1771609277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/extras/47e9d1c9fef499d10c4e9620312c3a58.mp4?t=1771609277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/extras/c58343ef71d5cec573ab356472fa8230.avif?t=1771609277\" alt=\"Uncover the story\" width=618 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth about the museum Curator. Why is the museum struggling and what more can you do to help out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/extras/872f1a9f518b8a5667d1b2f0f07da06f.poster.avif?t=1771609277\" aria-label=\"A man in a top hat speaks. The Curator: &amp;quot;Wow! You have really done a GOOD JOB here! That was our first guest in months!&amp;quot;\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/extras/872f1a9f518b8a5667d1b2f0f07da06f.webm?t=1771609277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/extras/872f1a9f518b8a5667d1b2f0f07da06f.mp4?t=1771609277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/extras/420527a3fc0ec05d9fb53ac74b8e47dd.avif?t=1771609277\" alt=\"Features\" width=618 height=124 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different subjects to paint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wholesome vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied game length depending on long you spend painting.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917260?t=1771609277","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917260?t=1771609277","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/5992e8b75541ed507a60e0842361536eebf4f633/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771609277","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917260/5992e8b75541ed507a60e0842361536eebf4f633/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771609277","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p